  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Application\'s Scope**\n\nI\'m zeroing in on defining the application\'s core scope: crafting a React web app mirroring the provided mockup. My focus is on faithfully capturing the \"Rayoba Media | The Grand Entrance\" branding within the application\'s structure and styling. This entails a deep dive into the mockup\'s visual language and functionality.\n\n\n**Developing the Visual Framework**\n\nI am now focusing on integrating the provided assets, specifically the origin story logo and the \"Luminous Brand Identity\" picture, into the application\'s structure. The goal is to accurately represent Rayoba Media\'s brand identity. I\'m prioritizing implementing the dark mode theme with a smooth transition, along with animations. Clean responsive layout, perfect typography and margins are key.\n\n\n**Integrating Visual Assets**\n\nI\'m now integrating the provided \"Sovereign Social Cloud\" vehicle image, along with the transparent logo files. Checking the prompt\'s HTML, I found the exact image URLs for the Origin Logo. I\'m focusing on incorporating these elements seamlessly into the React app, ensuring visual consistency with the Rayoba Media brand.\n\n\n**Identifying Asset URLs**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the image URLs for \"Product 1 (moody office)\" and \"Product 2 (Sovereign Social Cloud car)\" from the available data. I\'m ready to start integrating these within the React component, maintaining fidelity to the original branding. My next step will be to explore a Chain-of-Thought setup, as suggested, to identify the most relevant skills.\n\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 8
      nanos: 118487259
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
