  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Rayoba Media**\n\nI\'m now diving into defining the mock data and content for \"Rayoba Media.\" My aim is to make it editorial and realistic. I\'m focusing on beautiful, evocative copy that precisely adheres to the established style guidelines. This involves crafting components that feel both genuine and aesthetically pleasing.\n\n\n**Structuring Project Data**\n\nI\'ve decided to put all of the service and project data into a dedicated `/src/data.ts` file, a key step toward keeping the codebase modular and preventing token limit issues. I\'m focusing on defining our graphic design service now. I\'ve begun to articulate the services, descriptions, methodologies, deliverables, and timelines. The goal is to make it as structured as possible.\n\n\n**Articulating Service Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing the deliverables and timelines for the remaining services. For social strategy, I\'m focusing on \"Sovereign Content Playbook,\" \"Custom Story Framings,\" \"Campaign Production Design,\" and an \"Influence Partnerships Matrix,\" with a \"Continuous / Monthly\" timeline. I\'m also planning the email marketing component, which will be built around \"Sovereign Newsletter Frameworks,\" \"Customer Retention Pipelines,\" \"Copywriting Tone of Voice Guide,\" and \"Behavioral Auditing,\" set to complete in \"3 - 5 Weeks.\" I\'ve begun framing our projects.\n\n\n**Defining \"Enlightened Capital\"**\n\nI\'m now focusing on a \"Visual Overhaul\" project for \"Enlightened Capital,\" a venture fund. I\'m prioritizing an aesthetic of \"quiet dominance and supreme stability\" in the identity, packaging, and digital infrastructure. I\'m focusing on deliverables like a \"Visual Brand Identity Suite\", \"Custom Crest Emblem,\" and \"Interactive Investment Dashboard Layout\". My primary goal is to position venture backing as a premium editorial experience to inspire confidence.\n\n\n**Showcasing Recent Projects**\n\nI\'m now integrating recent project case studies. For \"Enlightened Cap. LLC\" in 2025, I\'m noting key results like \"15 days,\" \"98% client brand recognition recall across high-net-worth circles,\" and the \"Premium Design Excellence Guild award.\" I\'m also adding \"Sovereign Social Cloud,\" a \"Digital Creative\" project with a \"SOCIAL CAMPAIGN\" tag. I\'m focusing on its description, a relevant image URL, long-form description of its campaign in Tokyo, and deliverables like \"18 Custom Instagram Editorial Stories,\" \"Interactive Web Roadmap,\" and print packaging designs.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 16
      nanos: 607252319
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
