    thinking: "**Celebrating Successful Build**\n\nThe build completed without a hitch; it\'s quite exhilarating. My focus has now shifted to crafting a detailed response for the user. I\'m excited to explain my design choices, interactive elements, and visual identity implementation. I will craft a great explanation.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the development of the **Rayoba Media** web application. Below is a comprehensive overview of the design concepts and interactive systems implemented:\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual & Conceptual Identity\n* **Ivory & Sovereign Theme Selection**: Styled the core container with an adjustable theme canvas, transitioning between a crisp gilded-ivory background accented with warm yellow-gold highlights (`#D4AF37`) and a prestigious deeply elegant dark slate theme (`#0A0A0B`) with deep-violet accents.\n* **Luminous Interactive Background**: Added a custom background glowing-radial orb that dynamically tracks cursor movements with smooth elastic interpolation (lerping), creating an ambient and physical depth.\n* **Refined Typography Pairing**: Styled titles in **Playfair Display** (a timeless serif) paired with **Plus Jakarta Sans** for metadata tags and descriptions to achieve a highly legible, premium editorial rhythm.\n* **Atmospheric Film Grain**: Applied a subtle, responsive visual grain texture overlay (`opacity: 0.03`) mirroring premium modern high-fashion print layouts.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\217\233\357\270\217 Interactive Modules & Portfolios\n1. **Interactive Origin Story (\"The Birth of Rayoba\")**:\n   * Centered the brand story around Yoruba-and-light-convergence roots (\"Ray\" and \"Oba\").\n   * Interactive badges allow users to click and expand cards explaining the deep-seated strategic philosophies of absolute clarity and sovereign authority.\n2. **Royal Arsenal Bento Grid**:\n   * Divided agency offerings into an asymmetrical grid including Custom Branded Graphics, WebFlagships, Social grids, and Segmented news pipelines.\n   * Clicking asymmetrically styled bento-grid cells activates a detailed overlay revealing exact artisan deliverables, timeline milestones, and execution methodologies.\n3. **Legacy of Light Project Portfolio**:\n   * Displayed projects with high-resolution cinematic photos that smoothly transform from black-and-white (grayscale) to vivid color on hover.\n   * Leveraged filter tags (**All / Branding / Digital Creative**) to allow instant sorting.\n   * Clicking **\"View Case Study\"** opens an impressive case summary illustrating the client, targets, deliverables lists, and sovereign high-impact results.\n4. **Interactive Legacy Builder (Consultation Blueprint Planner)**:\n   * Built an inline consultation planning tool where users can enter their brand name, representative email, select their current business stature, and desired channels of interest.\n   * Automatically calculates and generates a custom formatted **Sovereign Strategy Blueprint** featuring a unique tracking reference, recommended asset lists, personalized timelines, and aesthetic prescriptions. \n\nThe application is fully responsive on mobile viewports with an animated slide-down navigation menu, customized tap states, and smooth slide-in transitions. All code compiled and verified successfully."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 294168708
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
