    thinking: "**Analyzing Dark Mode Implementation**\n\nI\'m currently reviewing the existing implementation for the dark mode toggle. Specifically, I\'m examining `Navbar.tsx` and how it manages the `.dark` class. My focus is understanding how this class impacts the color palette of the app\'s background. I\'m checking that the class is adding and removing correctly, and how we are using it to affect our design.\n\n\n**Investigating Tailwind Dark Mode**\n\nI\'m now investigating how the current styling depends on the `.dark` class. My exploration has revealed that Tailwind v4, which we\'re using, offers built-in dark mode support via media queries. However, our configuration, and how we are currently using the code, seems to hint at a manual toggle approach. I\'m focusing on the `class` pattern, particularly in relation to our `tailwind.config` and `src/index.css` files, to understand how we\'ve configured this, and if it\'s the optimal approach given Tailwind\'s capabilities.\n\n\n"
