      title: "medium.com"
    }
    summary: "Tailwind CSS v4 introduces a \"CSS-first\" approach for configuration, changing how dark mode is implemented compared to previous versions. While v4 defaults to using the user\'s operating system preference via `@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)`, you can re-enable a class-based dark mode strategy (e.g., by toggling a `.dark` class on your `<html>` element) using the `@variant` or `@custom-variant` directive in your CSS.[1][2][3]\n\nTo implement a class-based dark mode in Tailwind CSS v4:\n*   **Define the Dark Mode Variant**: You need to add a `@variant` or `@custom-variant` directive to your main CSS file (e.g., `app.css`, `index.css`, or `global.css`). This directive creates a custom Tailwind variant named `dark` that targets elements when a parent has the `.dark` class.[1][4][5][6][7]\n\n    A common syntax for this is:\n    \n\nSources:\n[1] [digitalapplied.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF0QNpBtATLANVYlH2GFD380aI55o-p7QUvotDL8bHhlagyQC07yeZT_aMjFM635ohW9sJB0IIbzJOpOHTQ7hc4NiQb3eonnCw0droiRLH902gHSjjqHU1SBuh-eylc_vsSmV8JA0EHwglT796X0dsF6042r-jt61gJh3xDGCDxJn1HN4UUHGj4aVmj)\n[2] [tailkits.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHx9SqcMGzn9qd4CKU_886fPu_dX8eylbUSf3oBN1hV7rsq4ElTlHJIbka0SDiWIaLn844ppdda9u8_UqWo_dfsUGXvA7BJNMwQqpHvn3-UjQwJUO-CN6MKHSIY2h1YxaT4SYYdxqFnpEQL8KOsTjRsiyph)\n[3] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGv86uPWDZqE05yXmLIQga-Z6vhubzuHDNGmBp918w97sov7JwNFfGU-olpOzvgF80o-A5DoOOzqFJQ4fvOX9uFxtaFLUX-5iIwoO_QyrnWFVNWG7Gi9MXgsI014pBqyNkVOT9tELx6LEAyuGmRZw60tW6POcMmy1Q5p-ThM0Upj10El7944po5cHENXJj7GMzN3XcCeJV3Fw==)\n[4] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGpGebB7H_iUVuo3wr6CVcVaMTL3jhZ6RwyQz_3YyFIOb5XFX1hPzruQjKWCKtyeYC9IdsWb3w70bo9NK5C0vaxr5bg4Udf3OFagxpwgONaVInC38OlPAc2kAfkEYpa_abad06gPEipLIGjB_ydCyLLZ3IT)\n[5] [kitemetric.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtlH3f_7Z0ksuAy4hhvpsWeD_Scqk8OsxhBL3jfdaqQC7jJChdPipnxJ86LZAKA5a4JR4Vo1WbesvwQJh1GIqRrpbZYfsRe8Ez1S9uklBD8YGmkGhrWq67g6OlMasD7B-vGmX4mMYeDoatsz0zJ_oS3vcD1lBYWtvkniD7ohMjwoYdJFkn6XqG9rqAzz41a-dpOjfg)\n[6] [tailwindcss.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGk1ocMeRtPHhYuTlEjqwf4HTtcDkxMpR-XziasvRxzi9_yeYtz3UjnMkS5nj7uq8EWnhNlh2M8V6DR2I98ZFDYUWPdS7HHhCk7B61FsUBbIOvdosI8W54BrU4gdgFB6xPD)\n[7] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFx81qwUYj0xAwuPv4zLNvhbPfZv2aCtmX4Qe-mP2-Ox696ZYq1xzNbSJhf-SBsjy_BdVcE2_i2aH7h6n6m9bEFgU56SHystkzoBvD1J5WnODhecLjwAAl5KCPHOHvFFmadcZUAvh9Y08PnfoLOmvmmNq5ArP8G9aPO_YSaHq-1GZSx8XJ8n-dCSW9eXVqvGTi7ZxG2L0hgPtSciaZdJQTZ547KFe4nfQ==)\n[8] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGhHQy2zhO0TUkM2Q8WwbUtfCnmas7I5Ufz95v80DCBAwhU6n3JhkTj5ChqXSsyGKWJQE5rdAy4lik_Tg0H2HGlAu0ZxDOLaSPtruzQhBrRLJqbU7_rWvJLQc_9trQEY_bjFBYm1_n5pZEhcKPyRdmPgRn_fUVEMS2zh7ctRqfG8F8U3EvC15-I_oqPh769HHGgtjFbkdzWffyJO06siwTJVEpvOA==)"
