    summary: "To manually toggle dark mode in Tailwind CSS v4, you can override the default `prefers-color-scheme` behavior by configuring a custom dark mode selector. This allows you to control the dark theme using a CSS class or data attribute on an ancestor element, typically the `<html>` element.[1]\n\nHere\'s a breakdown of the process:\n*   **CSS Setup**: In your main CSS file (e.g., `app.css`), you\'ll define a custom variant for dark mode. This tells Tailwind CSS to apply dark mode styles when a specific selector is present. A common approach is to use a custom variant named `dark` that looks for a `.dark` class on a parent element.[2][3][1]\n\n    \n\nSources:\n[1] [tailwindcss.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHTz34Tnr0kYqrVw0FVO5k_LGbCK-9w8DGGP1jsv6FyOjIA1HRxvGhVz-MJTWKbxkWGKXcxYmzw4RDu2-PDTGjK6UXmZtPnZWQ1-ewJKka5cJHDVLFX_EYnpkgixklYASVy)\n[2] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGWblFCg75vxwjELwU7vATcEEKyFYngTaKUoLZ2HF5w9eoahnWjaRFVdRy-HCE8I4D4nz62K3zrtsM8ixoBu9cO4mO9cJTyX-G17SxEIuWhWRhdmvBFZcaCQ_OJ7TVxML8EfL1BE5E=)\n[3] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUonN6rAAVdch3otmUi_rV-4PBHW4bBmY6_FGlOLLY1wIHt1Bnri19IRZ_Xj_kfiVhWW52Js6sallOF1JKyVW3MimnfufzBnROU4WxingNaRnidRjHVah04RIRKZrTOrP_UYDCYUbSfVV5p01RnWcY9sEh)\n[4] [weitzel.dev](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGCiNkIrf0m_EdjJ2m5JvQXfok4u0B3Hwbqiwc-wQW8TrYthrF_JY4g2JZ83Y_JtdG4dXO1iWhRQZE2Lr1wLKM6Vuzr5cxbtTTr5U7vXcrRYlyXMJJmrJjrcNw2BR3eCrBMuoNkzm0=)\n[5] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH-bLJJUs1FzXpUJ0ZgJ1u8yITy7wNUmftAJEk-G7wb1rslVReUqC2pP-Zex6kHM3CVPhRF2v6YXolLPmDBolAe_ane3JWa9minwcxSoqYI6rOVnpuFUwQgfa1zxnWX5zZPrJzIhxFRPtiQ2DLPalgHuP-92rCw0J7MyRlu5VxD6IiYRLQG88DDS5wG1aIfD206T6c7wRT2yDMwpxwq39xcBtfmSsWgkuqnY_fOXviOSlY=)\n[6] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH16d5HoaNRQCs9XRhgK3vmisY1tw6cCS51y9E9pgAhQbn3f0bK4vscwzw_0hUwnUHb5XksuPOZQU1vgIRW8iCDWeGS63eiEMBGyGVSHLqnIOLwiAm6v5P7qMn_dBuaYQL5T2qlBSk=)\n[7] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQETKAgLtfqEUbjoWPgRq_zDo7uXtqNtrpYvGchBhan6_a7WUiqH0Az7G16Fplmh0Vira2VSugDKwQgdZXaueQhumEFLQSQ_jkc7ZNNqDgVV0QeVDujUH77ST2fTOUBNK-w8CanSbp9yE5ldOEn-9nx7kKPQ)\n[8] [preline.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGxJNlawF8xmMw1L5LBDqoESEh-DzvI-_4P7dILiuCH3eihC1ZG0AQAbzlEI67dLQlS2aMd64voYZwEaanV9Q7HeZo4JstjlKwFZY7Xx6Bzlilv4LXJC-V505BEA9OjfX_s)"
