      chunks {
        position: 5
        markdown_chunk {
          headers {
            type: MARKDOWN_NODE_TYPE_HEADER_1
            text: "[NoClassDefFoundError for javax.security.RunAs when using Jakarta Annotations API 2.1.1 on Spring Boot 2.7](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/78229415/noclassdeffounderror-for-javax-security-runas-when-using-jakarta-annotations-api)"
          }
          text: "[NoClassDefFoundError for javax.security.RunAs when using Jakarta Annotations API 2.1.1 on Spring Boot 2.7](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/78229415/noclassdeffounderror-for-javax-security-runas-when-using-jakarta-annotations-api)\n[Ask Question](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/ask)\n[2 years, 2 months ago](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/78229415/how-to-configure-dark-mode-in-tailwind-css-v4?lastactivity)\nI am using spring boot 2.7 version and recently upgraded jakarta.annotations-api.2.1.1 version. After this when I started application, I getting error like\n\n```\njakarta.annotations-api.2.1.1\n```\n\n\n```\nNo class deffounderror for javax.security.RunAs\n```\n\n\n```\nNo class deffounderror for javax.security.RunAs\n```\n\nHow can I fix this issue?\n- [spring-boot](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/spring-boot)\n- [jakarta-annotations](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/jakarta-annotations)\n[spring-boot](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/spring-boot)\n[jakarta-annotations](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/jakarta-annotations)\n[Share](https://stackoverflow.com/q/78229415)\n[Improve this question](https://stackoverflow.com/posts/78229415/edit)\n[edited Mar 27, 2024 at 11:01](https://stackoverflow.com/posts/78229415/revisions)\n[BalusC](https://stackoverflow.com/users/157882/balusc)\n[venky jillella](https://stackoverflow.com/users/23822598/venky-jillella)\n- \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                You should\'nt mix up packages. Each Spring Boot version has its tested dependencies which you should use. If you wanna use Jakarta then upgrade to Spring Boot 3+, otherwise stick with javax. Everything else is just painful.\n\n\n                    [Slevin](https://stackoverflow.com/users/13609359/slevin)\n\342\200\223\302\240\n                        Slevin\n\n                2024-03-27 04:58:45 +00:00\n\n                    Commented\n                    Mar 27, 2024 at 4:58\n\n\n\n\n[Slevin](https://stackoverflow.com/users/13609359/slevin)\n[Add a comment](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/78229415/how-to-configure-dark-mode-in-tailwind-css-v4)"
        }
      }
      chunks {
        position: 6
        markdown_chunk {
          headers {
            type: MARKDOWN_NODE_TYPE_HEADER_1
            text: "[NoClassDefFoundError for javax.security.RunAs when using Jakarta Annotations API 2.1.1 on Spring Boot 2.7](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/78229415/noclassdeffounderror-for-javax-security-runas-when-using-jakarta-annotations-api)"
          }
          headers {
            type: MARKDOWN_NODE_TYPE_HEADER_2
            text: "1 Answer 1"
          }
          headers {
            type: MARKDOWN_NODE_TYPE_HEADER_2
            text: "Comments"
          }
          headers {
            type: MARKDOWN_NODE_TYPE_HEADER_2
            text: "Your Answer"
          }
          text: "## 1 Answer 1\n[Reset to default](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/78229415/noclassdeffounderror-for-javax-security-runas-when-using-jakarta-annotations-api?answertab=scoredesc#tab-top)\nJavax API what you need to add.\n\n```\n<!-- https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/javax.annotation/javax.annotation-api --> <dependency> <groupId>javax.annotation</groupId> <artifactId>javax.annotation-api</artifactId> <version>1.3.2</version> </dependency>\n```\n\n\n```\n<!-- https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/javax.annotation/javax.annotation-api --> <dependency> <groupId>javax.annotation</groupId> <artifactId>javax.annotation-api</artifactId> <version>1.3.2</version> </dependency>\n```\n\nYou can also visit [this answer](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/48238014/how-can-be-solved-java-lang-noclassdeffounderror-javax-annotation-generated).\n[Share](https://stackoverflow.com/a/78229785)\n[Improve this answer](https://stackoverflow.com/posts/78229785/edit)\n[raiwaqar](https://stackoverflow.com/users/19864484/raiwaqar)\n\n## Comments\nAdd a comment\n\n## Your Answer\nThanks for contributing an answer to Stack Overflow!\n- Please be sure to answer the question. Provide details and share your research!\nBut avoid \342\200\246\n- Asking for help, clarification, or responding to other answers.\n- Making statements based on opinion; back them up with references or personal experience.\nTo learn more, see our [tips on writing great answers](https://stackoverflow.com/help/how-to-answer)."
        }
      }
