    summary: "In Tailwind CSS v4, the configuration for class-based dark mode has shifted from JavaScript-based `tailwind.config.js` to a CSS-first approach, primarily utilizing the `@custom-variant` directive. This change eliminates the `darkMode: \'class\'` or `darkMode: \'media\'` settings previously found in the configuration file[1][2][3].\n\nTo implement a class-based dark mode in Tailwind CSS v4, you define a custom variant in your main CSS file (e.g., `index.css` or `global.css`) using `@custom-variant`. The common selector for a class-based dark mode is:\n\n\n\nSources:\n[1] [tailkits.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEDQCAyYuaCbU9S0uEulRwTAXjeOV9OTqqCVHhwh2wQp0XQrnkUDUbucoQL_r4dKNxyC0YUz_WiIVO25OkWMQKd1NNGQJDcYxHabkLvwzOJRpIVQexzVWLehN-c4DAI-ttSc1h0pp6lOO30IAKqTNluJ1Xs)\n[2] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHrIubR_PiKyBoy9fi8d4_2XFm7FzDkULMR6sWU5QGweFy-Av6zTZGBKoBbQBf5zwb7xuRjmC8e0YAPX3w1D9czsnMozIk8KNr9FD8-e6Y_7I_-dLTe69bF6Clp9uqT7O2ln_U90w8KHnSsYnPRiN4k8BUtgBuXg1VhdxJUcw2h0hHfbRQ5D8Fcj1h74tZcTOkdGxSTliOB-VQdfMsX4t-gZP7lIg==)\n[3] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUtfLZlVQ8mMFyzhtv8Cv15XT59KkI0gF8CgfdhGLkTwYz2f78uGkalB-vNF6SOAZctRjabvI96DSeNzVQDR5VArx7M1R6tMhDnVrkEvXHNVo4s5Du3XvgklotFr_zsDFPKVa3iGdpeDM7kVJvvdjQK5JNbAuX3UyxCaGZFZwULaz_wC-_95JTETLXH2y0m3CUH-9o7dj6_g==)\n[4] [kitemetric.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUseb4lwSXvnIvrDyMUuOYv_x-RpRaZZ3zNEJmkIiAJSWy0l2G7mQYupoF2wpjmwl712O5QTTfFK6sl7fPRVXNeDfnmcbD6bwTx1uUH0ET4uXV9kRgzx8BZlPr_N6OFTwsRVQ9VGZItlqbbShkcr_AdNfF3ZISQWI9yrB_qb-5fUGx_Mj1ywrtTXyW-bC1-xQzM-mT)\n[5] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHwtI9LNAY4fdFoToWjHHheoz172F2aO52oeX-Hhr9R_BBmZsbRtiD_PdgoDal40UqDPsPRaPotuS14rRr8veDCvr6fWoH-l97Hizi_ciXGpnLTgFxNnu8n-vILF0znNv0kB1ClAS1KG8DiBqEhBDCcABHZ)\n[6] [reddit.com](https://