    summary: "Tailwind CSS v4 introduces a significant shift in how dark mode is configured, moving to a \"CSS-first\" approach that eliminates the need for `tailwind.config.js` for dark mode settings[1][2]. The older `darkMode: \'class\'` or `darkMode: \'media\'` configuration keys from v3 are no longer used[1].\n\nIn Tailwind v4, dark mode behavior is defined directly within your CSS using `@custom-variant` or `@variant` directives[1][3][4][2].\n\nHere\'s a breakdown of dark mode implementation in Tailwind v4:\n\n*   **Default Dark Mode (System Preference)**: By default, Tailwind v4 leverages the user\'s operating system preference via `prefers-color-scheme`. The `dark:` variant is automatically active when the system is set to dark mode, requiring no additional configuration for this behavior[1][3][5].\n\n*   **Manual Dark Mode Toggling**: To implement a manual dark mode toggle (e.g., with a button), you override the default `dark` variant in your main CSS file. Instead of relying on `prefers-color-scheme`, you can configure the `dark:` variant to respond to a custom CSS selector, such as a class (e.g., `.dark`) or a data attribute (e.g., `[data-theme=\"dark\"]`) on a top-level element like `<html>`[1][3][4][2][5].\n\n    *   **Using `@custom-variant dark` or `@variant dark`**:\n        To achieve manual toggling, you\'ll add a line similar to this in your CSS file (e.g., `app.css` or `index.css`):\n        \n\nSources:\n[1] [tailkits.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF3iOnQsNCeDTdo643_5gyYpR9qD0Oeyl82VK_25SNJV4WPc4-rA5Ts3PohUU5rD2HLbU9NR5M1PNFr-LZQoR4lCrBdECxfQg63K9MZXVzo4ocnqnZOVZKBjtcWTrah3oginyxIDy4N3xuvJRsnQXvraQv4)\n[2] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHkwyQS28Q2ZCXfoviOLXpjlrfEvv7seK4Wt1__-ysoIBPPbqVI29YOBI7z_2hz2aU0x6dUeZWaY1-Ko8-y-QOeXtDMxF-7etQq09bpC2L4MRvXneX_KtVEVXF6fUbuldeIfWtDZHfv_IXp3vNTkKzrozt7lsBcL-gt8aIz3Crqx05r62zPk8HyXjxaJnl4qqrut3PcKElzZ5qaAOcPzjqhO9ZG0g==)\n[3] [thingsaboutweb.dev](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFJnE2FqpA-0-nSry-pISnBRDWZHSzZX_qbOOcqQDOnMGMErQsfikP0arPFEKYIDFeYFECl1Y9DQFgOXcq1DUHUvBUBdTJeUKIsmgbo7Z2cA27QcOG6UVpdMqVv6whOW6GRvCqmB-4mEXqEtvzHoPHDkwU3QYGVkCqCUeVLnu6saLD0n2M=)\n[4] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGpMewS16eX-vFDjkykx8EQlxhWDtiH_slBpjguLWOqObUvb41jdRfpYvGq5nAgv1Q1YcCqeu-DxcshatR_9LJ3Vg2Kfu7ouLJxCH-U5tKSVtR27Am0FKbjxmunIDN11liWUxEQa-6lP0R2hiMrqh8R14Oe)\n[5] [stevekinney.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEnAzTPcTOfhqPPq8K6rBHxvFhcXhQfbypHIFQPRHIAwiZEFaFxYPVLIf2GhI8N9BXo-FFKsAFW4zHHkeDG0Fgqrf3oajnmlCxt8Zor3PzhJjM4YOg3sAsNWvp9g1OXegVfoaSAAp04nVjve58k)\n[6] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFBlot5LDqjSeoiQ-fYOF570YQZTziIte6cCXgBj4xQzLCT7BRlh53TxNvOqrXJJwoExcUwh7gxIre-YSgzZ09cuTh9QCJUSX1il2wZNb4d9K7HjoxQfU384jU19YfaQCiR8edsJlo=)"
