de icons, focusing on aesthetic consistency with \"light_mode\", \"menu\", and \"play_circle\". I\'m meticulously checking the `lucide-react` import list to ensure a cohesive visual language, opting for icons like `Play`, `PlayCircle`, and `Layers`, and avoiding custom SVG imports. I\'m verifying that the icons are all being correctly imported into the `PortfolioPage.tsx` file, before proceeding to update the file.\n\n\n**Constructing Modal Overlays**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the modal overlays for the \"Works in Motion\" section. I\'m planning to create detailed case-study modals for active selections, showing objectives, deliverables, key parameters, and metrics. These will represent cinematic clips of master watches, photography production layouts, cinema spots, and premium lifestyle architecture. Also I\'m planning a \"Play\" modal simulated frame for motion reels.\n\n**Integrating Visuals**\n\nI\'m now examining the visual assets the user provided. I\'ll integrate the architectural structure image and the workspace workspace image into the \"Structural Excellence\" and \"Case Detail 01\" sections, respectively, for a cohesive design experience.\n\n\n**Incorporating Case Study Images**\n\nI\'m now integrating the provided visual assets. The Cybersecurity hub image will enhance the \"Digital Fortress\" section, and the Star Planet network image will be used in \"Case Detail 02\". I\'m meticulously ensuring these additions bolster design coherence.\n\n\n**Adding Reel Previews**\n\nI\'m now integrating video thumbnails for the production, cinema, and lifestyle reels. I\'ve successfully implemented previews for these media assets. I\'m focusing on ensuring visual consistency. I will be incorporating the provided links for these previews.\n\n\n**Overhauling PortfolioPage.tsx**\n\nI\'m now completely restructuring `PortfolioPage.tsx`. I\'ll use `create_file` with `Overwrite: true` to provide a pristine, complete implementation, ensuring the file\'s content matches the updated design. This approach ensures a clean and error-free integration of the new components and interactive elements. I\'m focusing on incorporating the visual assets for the new modules I am building.\n\n\n"
