  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Compilation Success**\n\nThe successful compilation of `lint_applet` and `compile_applet` is truly impressive. However, my focus has shifted towards the necessary communication templates, specifically under the \"Communication\" guidelines. The current draft for a simple query doesn\'t quite match what we\'ve built, so I\'m refining that section.\n\n\n**Refining the Portfolio Layout**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the aesthetic design of the new portfolio page. I\'ve established a structured layout for the \"Curated Showcase\" using Inter for interface hierarchy and Playfair Display for editorial displays. I\'m aiming for a clear and easily scannable presentation, using bullet points for key functional modules. I want the tone to be friendly and helpful, speaking objectively, clearly, and professionally. The checklists are focused on high-level outcomes.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have finalized the Portfolio page according to your layout specifications. Both code linting and compilation checks succeeded successfully. Here is a design and functional overview of what has been implemented:\n\n### Portfolio Architecture & Interactive Features\n\n- **Editorial Headings**: Styled the primary displays using elegant **Playfair Display** typography paired with clean **Inter (Plus Jakarta Sans)** body alignments and balanced negative spacing. \n- **Interactive 3D Mouse Tilts**: Implemented a responsive React cursor listener on each archival card. When hovered, the card calculates relative 2D mouse orientations to render a realistic 3D spatial tilt effect instantly.\n- **Unified Category Filtering**: Integrated full query selectors supporting `All Works`, `Branding`, `Digital Creative`, `Editorial`, `Cinematography`, and `Strategy` domains to easily organize active cases.\n- **Scrollytelling Case Showcases**:\n  - **Structural Excellence**: Features clean architectural backdrops, minimalist workspace mockups, key benchmarks, and strategic narrative overlays.\n  - **Digital Fortress**: Showcases global star planet network particles, cyber-security parameters, and high-fidelity interface layouts.\n- **Works in Motion (Masonry Video Reels)**: Formed a fluid asymmetrical column grid depicting cinematic clips\342\200\224Precision Horology, Studio Production, the Cinema Projector, and the High-Prestige Twilight Villa.\n- **Rich Case Lightboxes & Simulative Streaming Overlays**: Selecting any case study triggers an immersive full-screen details container outlining objectives, deliverables, client credentials, and metrics, while clicking motion videos summons a dark simulated cinematic screen with streaming layers."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 12259102
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
