`bento-vid-2`, and `bento-vid-3`. I\'m replacing the `div` elements with `motion.div` and integrating `handleCardMouseMove` and `handleCardMouseLeave` for the tilt logic. This ensures a consistent and responsive hover experience across the `ServicesPage.tsx`, enhancing visual appeal.\n\n\n**Enhancing Tilt Logic**\n\nI\'m now integrating the tilt effect within the `bento-vid-1` element, implementing `handleCardMouseMove` and `handleCardMouseLeave` to control the rotation angles, ensuring a more responsive and attractive hover effect. I am using `motion.div` for smoother transitions and a refined user experience.\n\n\n**Adding Hover Scale Effect**\n\nI\'m now incorporating a subtle hover scale effect to the design cards on the `ServicesPage.tsx`. I\'m focusing on the `transformStyle` property set to \'preserve-3d\' and leveraging `whileHover` to increase scale slightly on hover with a smooth transition. I\'m carefully applying these enhancements to maintain the existing layout and aesthetic of each card. I\'ve updated the first card using `multi_edit_file`.\n\n\n**Integrating Tilt Logic**\n\nI\'ve integrated the tilt effect into the second and third bento cards by replacing `div` elements with `motion.div` and incorporating `handleCardMouseMove` and `handleCardMouseLeave` for tilt logic. I\'m focusing on seamless transitions using `transform` to get a consistent hover experience on `ServicesPage.tsx`. The goal is a polished and engaging visual effect.\n\n\n**Refining Bento Card Logic**\n\nI\'m now refining the logic for the second bento card, `bento-vid-2`, on the `ServicesPage.tsx`. I\'ve added a `motion.div` component and integrated `handleCardMouseMove` and `handleCardMouseLeave` to implement the tilt effect. I\'m focusing on ensuring a polished and engaging visual effect by including hover scale. I\'m working to make the hover animation smooth and responsive using `transformStyle` and `transition` for a refined user experience.\n\n\n**Implementing Bento Card**\n\nI\'m now implementing the tilt effect on the third Bento Card, `bento-vid-3`, integrating `handleCardMouseMove` and `handleCardMouseLeave` for the tilt logic within `motion.div`. I\'m focusing on ensuring a consistent and engaging user experience on `ServicesPage.tsx`, using `transform` for smooth transitions. The overall goal is a consistent and responsive hover effect.\n\n\n"
